sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Native Client
  participant K as Keycloak
  participant G as Gorape
  participant R as Redis
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  C->>K: Authorization Code + PKCE
  K-->>C: Access token
  C->>G: registration/challenge + token
  G->>G: Validate JWT, Project, RBAC
  G->>R: Store random challenge with TTL
  G-->>C: Challenge
  C->>C: Generate hardware key and evidence
  C->>G: registration/verify
  G->>R: Atomic consume
  G->>G: Chain, challenge, key binding
  G->>P: Transactionally store device/key/record/event
  G-->>C: Device
